  <prompt>Apply Class-A rows A13, A14, A17, A18, A19, A20, A21, A22, A23, A25, A26, A27 from `notes/task-202-punch-list.md` — the bicep hardening sub-phase of task 203. All rows are bicep-module authoring, module wiring, or a PowerShell operator runbook execution (A26). Row-by-row: (a) grep-verify current repo state BEFORE applying (many rows may have landed via Wave G-8 batch 155-198+); (b) if `already-applied`, annotate row + skip; (c) if `open`, apply per row landing-spot + effort; (d) `az bicep build` dry-run + `dotnet build src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane.Core/` sanity after every 3 rows; (e) checkpoint via context-handoff after every 3 rows. Scope: SB Data Receiver RBAC on L2 UAMI (A13); Bicep config-key aliases (`Cosmos:AccountEndpoint`, `ServiceBus:FullyQualifiedNamespace`, `ManagedIdentity:ClientId`) matching code readers (A14); NEW `controlplane-artifacts-storage.bicep` module wired into `platform-controlplane.bicep` (A17); NEW `controlplane-acr.bicep` module + `acrImageTag`/`sidecarAuthType` params (A18); L2 UAMI sub Contributor + Storage Blob Data Reader + AcrPull (A19); H4-shared handler 5-6 UAMI role assignments on shared source services (A20); L2 UAMI Website Contributor on target BFF App Service (A21); FromBicepOutput KV wire-up (A22 — MAJOR GAP, one of three approaches per row); kv-secrets.generated.bicep unconditional-ternary → skip-if-exists fix protecting BFF-API-ClientSecret + Dataverse-ClientSecret (A23); sharedBffUami KV Secrets User grant in model1-shared.bicep (A25); execute queue-recreate runbook (A26); CustomerRunGuard config provisioning (A27). Amend punch list annotations. Do NOT commit — main session handles commit after review. NFR-01 publish-size check: these changes do NOT touch `src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/**`, so no publish-size delta report needed (confirm in task summary).</prompt>

  <role>SPAARKE bicep infrastructure engineer + Azure RBAC specialist. Expert in: L2 control-plane bicep topology (`infrastructure/bicep/platform-controlplane.bicep` + child modules); UAMI role-assignment patterns (Website Contributor, Storage Blob Data Reader, AcrPull, Service Bus Data Receiver, Cognitive Services User, Search Service Contributor, SB Data Owner, Storage Contributor, Redis Cache Contributor, KV Secrets User); ACR sidecar image chain (per audit-gap-10 + sidecar-ci-workflow); KV secret provisioning + never-delete BFF-API/Dataverse-ClientSecret contract (BINDING per r3 handoff + project CLAUDE.md MUST rules); Service Bus session-receiver queue creation semantics (requiresSession + requiresDuplicateDetection creation-time-only per DS-2).</role>

  <goal>All 12 in-scope Class-A rows annotated with `last_known_status_after_execution` in `notes/task-202-punch-list.md`. Two new bicep modules exist and are wired: `infrastructure/bicep/modules/controlplane-artifacts-storage.bicep` (A17) + `infrastructure/bicep/modules/controlplane-acr.bicep` (A18). L2 UAMI role assignments landed: Service Bus Data Receiver (A13), sub Contributor + Storage Blob Data Reader + AcrPull (A19), Website Contributor on target BFF App Service (A21). H4-shared handler 5-6 UAMI role assignments landed on shared source services (A20). Bicep app-setting keys emitted match code readers exactly per DS-5 c5.1 + T113 (A14). FromBicepOutput KV wire-up path chosen from A22's three options + implemented + regression-checked against H4 quarantine scenario. `kv-secrets.generated.bicep` protects BFF-API-ClientSecret + Dataverse-ClientSecret via skip-if-exists guard (A23). `model1-shared.bicep` grants sharedBffUami KV Secrets User (A25). Queue-recreate runbook executed per DS-2 with requiresSession + requiresDuplicateDetection creation-time properties (A26). CustomerRunGuard config provisioned (A27). All bicep `az bicep build` dry-runs succeed. `dotnet build src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane.Core/` succeeds. NFR-01 confirmed non-applicable (zero BFF touch).</goal>

