    <step order="2" name="A14 apply (config-key aliases — highest impact)">EDIT `platform-controlplane.bicep` (and child modules as needed) to emit `Cosmos:AccountEndpoint`, `ServiceBus:FullyQualifiedNamespace`, `ManagedIdentity:ClientId` — matching code readers per DS-5 c5.1 + T113. Confirm no `Cosmos__Endpoint` / `ServiceBus__ConnectionString` regressions remain.</step>
    <step order="3" name="A12 (recheck if not applied in 203a)">This row lands in 203a but confirm no regression here.</step>
    <step order="4" name="A17 apply">Author `infrastructure/bicep/modules/controlplane-artifacts-storage.bicep` with punch list row A17 cited in header. Wire module into `platform-controlplane.bicep`.</step>
