  <notes>Justification (CLAUDE.md §11): Existing — task 202's punch list identifies 12 bicep-hardening rows; task 202 also authored punch list verification obligation. Extension — 203b applies bicep changes systematically; two NEW bicep modules extend existing `platform-controlplane.bicep` per audit-gap-05/10. Cost-of-doing-nothing — task 186 E2E fires against a live customer stamp; without A17/A18 the H2a + H14a pipelines cannot complete; without A19/A20/A21 the UAMI cannot execute its RBAC-scoped operations; without A22 fix H4 quarantines every fresh customer; without A23 fix a re-deploy will clobber BFF-API-ClientSecret + Dataverse-ClientSecret (BINDING violation); without A26 the queue rejects session-scoped messages. Any single missing row blocks task 186. NFR-01 does NOT apply (zero BFF touch).</notes>

